<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52469" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλᾰθος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[κᾰ]</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>basket narrow at the
				base</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1325
			</span></i> (lyr.); esp. for wool, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; for fruit, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1413a21
			</span></i>; carried in procession in honour of Demeter, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Cer.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gloss.Oxy.</u>
				1802
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				3.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Archit.,
				<i>capital of a column</i>, in this form, <i><span class="en">
				Callix.
				1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				4.1.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wine-cooler</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυκτήρ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>mould for casting iron</i>, Id. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>reservoir</i> of an oil-lamp, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				2.22
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
